   "id": "piv4-theorie",
   "type": "theory",
   "title": "Формы: сейчас, уже было, скоро",
   "content": "<p style='margin:0.6rem 0'><b>prendre</b> — брать: «Je <b>prends</b> la camionnette». И о времени: «Ça <b>prend</b> deux heures» — это займёт два часа. Внимание: nous pren<b>ons</b>, ils pre<b>nnent</b> — с двумя n. <b>mettre</b> — класть, надевать: «Je <b>mets</b> le casque». Прошедшее: j'ai <b>pris</b>, j'ai <b>mis</b>.</p><h3 style='margin:1rem 0 0.3rem'>prendre — брать</h3><table><tr><th>сейчас (présent)</th><th>уже было (passé composé)</th><th>скоро (futur proche)</th></tr><tr><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"je prends\">je prends</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"j'ai pris\">j'ai pris</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"je vais prendre\">je vais prendre</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"tu prends\">tu prends</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"tu as pris\">tu as pris</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"tu vas prendre\">tu vas prendre</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"il prend\">il prend</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"il a pris\">il a pris</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"il va prendre\">il va prendre</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"nous prenons\">nous prenons</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"nous avons pris\">nous avons pris</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"nous allons prendre\">nous allons prendre</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"vous prenez\">vous prenez</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"vous avez pris\">vous avez pris</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"vous allez prendre\">vous allez prendre</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"ils prennent\">ils prennent</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"ils ont pris\">ils ont pris</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"ils vont prendre\">ils vont prendre</span></td></tr></table><p style='margin:0.3rem 0 0.8rem;font-size:0.9em'>passé composé с <b>avoir</b>: причастие <b>pris</b> не меняется. Пример: <span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"Je prends la camionnette.\">Je prends la camionnette.</span></p><h3 style='margin:1rem 0 0.3rem'>mettre — класть, надевать</h3><table><tr><th>сейчас (présent)</th><th>уже было (passé composé)</th><th>скоро (futur proche)</th></tr><tr><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"je mets\">je mets</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"j'ai mis\">j'ai mis</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"je vais mettre\">je vais mettre</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"tu mets\">tu mets</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"tu as mis\">tu as mis</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"tu vas mettre\">tu vas mettre</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"il met\">il met</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"il a mis\">il a mis</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"il va mettre\">il va mettre</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"nous mettons\">nous mettons</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"nous avons mis\">nous avons mis</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"nous allons mettre\">nous allons mettre</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"vous mettez\">vous mettez</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"vous avez mis\">vous avez mis</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"vous allez mettre\">vous allez mettre</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"ils mettent\">ils mettent</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"ils ont mis\">ils ont mis</span></td><td><span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"ils vont mettre\">ils vont mettre</span></td></tr></table><p style='margin:0.3rem 0 0.8rem;font-size:0.9em'>passé composé с <b>avoir</b>: причастие <b>mis</b> не меняется. Пример: <span class=\"say\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-say=\"Je mets les gants.\">Je mets les gants.</span></p><p style='margin:0.6rem 0'>Нажмите на любую форму, чтобы услышать её.</p>"
